insert into items (id, title, author, stance, video_url, transcript) values
  ('aarchor', 'Never thought of this before huh?', 'aarchor', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_WNRmJQxjX0GVfKz', '["\"Oh, but if immigrants make America great, why didn''t they make their own country great?\" Maybe because you fucking bombed them and stole their resources. Instead of spending money at home making your country great, you spent money fucking up theirs. How about you please stop doing that?"]'),
  ('bettercallcj', '#worldcup #latino #immigrant #mexican #ice', 'bettercallcj', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_VBwmncDyoXfZcu0', '["Don’t let this World Cup hide the tragedies that are happening at this very moment in this country—the horrific inhumanity that is happening in O’Laney Hall, and the countless immigrant brothers and sisters that we have across the country that we have stories unheard of. Do not let this event hide these tragedies. Instead, use it as a moment of advocacy to speak the fuck up.", "I get it, I’m excited to see the national teams play out. I’m excited to see Mbappé ball out. I’m excited to see CR7 and Lionel Messi’s last dance. But the sad reality that we live in right now, we have to keep speaking up. The news cycles are getting ready to just outshine all this shit and just play soccer, soccer, soccer, or football. But this is the moment when we have the world''s eyes on us to shine a light on this. And I get it, it’s not like the world doesn''t know what''s going on in this country, but we must tell their stories.", "The stories that are just coming out of these detention centers are fucking horrific—being treated like dogs, the constant torturing, being fed food with maggots. Women, children in there. This shit is heartbreaking. For those who don''t know me, I go by CJ. I’m an Army veteran and now I am a teacher. But the way I was brought into this country was I was undocumented; I was a little child. And by the blessings, I became an American citizen. And to see folks treated with such—no humanity at all, just because they came here with the promise that we gave them, it’s fucking disgusting.", "I sure as hell know that this is not the America that I grew up in because we learned about Patrick Henry—his famous words. We learned about Thomas Jefferson, George Washington, Martin Luther King. And we get it, the struggle to make this country a more perfect union has not always been easy. A nation built by immigrants; documentation shouldn''t matter there because at the end of the day, we’re all fucking humans and nobody deserves to be treated like dogs. But once again, do not let the World Cup outshine the horrific shit that is happening to our immigrant brothers and sisters in this country."]'),
  ('ceceonthescene', 'Immigrants supporting mass deportations is just wild to me #magacult #fdt #kamalaharris #immigrantsmakeamericagreat #fyp #foryou #fafo', 'ceceonthescene', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_YT6j2xarp6qiFg1', '["This guy is sitting in a cell in Louisiana awaiting deportation because of the Trump regime''s immigration policies, and he still blames Biden. He gave an interview blaming the Biden administration for this. This guy, Casper Eriksen, he''s Danish. He''s been working towards becoming a citizen since 2009. He has a wife and kids here, but he''s still an immigrant. And they are loud and proud Trump supporters. They fell for the bullshit lie that Republicans would only target criminals. We warned you that they were lying about that. It was an open-book test.", "In 2015, Eriksen failed to submit a form. You submit a lot of forms while trying to become a citizen. He''s had more meetings since then, more correspondence from the immigration authorities, and no one ever mentioned this form. It just fell through the cracks. He had a meeting in April of this year; that was supposed to be his final meeting. This was supposed to formalize his naturalization. Instead, he was arrested and he was whisked off to Louisiana. An immigration official explained to him that if that final meeting had happened under the Biden administration, he probably would have been fine.", "Just to reiterate how deep the cult thinking goes: he failed to submit a form in 2015 when Obama was president. Immigration authorities under the Biden administration continued working with him. Now, he''s facing deportation under Trump, and he still blames Biden. I don''t have any sympathy because the Eriksens said a bunch of racist crap about immigrants. His wife said 90% of them don''t deserve to be in the country, they don''t speak English, they''re criminals. What a disgusting thing to say. And this guy, Casper, says, \"I''m a patriot. If you come to the US, you live and sound and behave like an American.\" Gross.", "If the facts of his case were presented to him, he would be in full support of deportation if he was presented with a scenario where a brown immigrant who had been in the country for decades, had a wife and four children, had been working hard, had been paying taxes, forgot to submit one form ten years ago and was now facing deportation. This guy and his wife would be all for it. That''s why I have no sympathy. Immigrants voting for mass deportations is just lunacy. But we know why they thought they would be safe."]'),
  ('enliven.inner.inte', 'ICE OUT#iceout #protest #viraltiktok #knowledge #strongertogether', 'enliven.inner.inte', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_2nWMO0Y0t215Zjx', '["ICE OUT.", "I have never been so proud of the children in this town for standing up for something that they believe in, in a world where they''re literally being programmed to be desensitized from everything. Violence is nothing, human rights are absolutely nothing, your freedoms are slowly being taken away. For these children to band together to do a protest today, and have backlash from the school, disciplinary actions for exercising your amendment rights—the freedom of speech and the freedom to assemble.", "These kids, they literally feel so strongly about the dehumanization of other people that they want to walk out of the school in 15-degree weather and walk to the town hall to have a voice. They''re getting backlash from the school, they''re getting backlash from hateful parents on like the local little forums, talking about pretty much \"so F, F immigrants, F illegal immigrants.\"", "And that brings me to the point of—what drugs are you on that you would assume somebody coming into this country illegally is going to go to a government facility that already hates them and say, \"I expect food stamps, I expect cash assistance, I want some Section 8 housing, and why don''t you give a G-E-N-D-E-R card?\" Like, does that make sense to you? Like, the fact that you can''t get out of your own head and see how dumb that sounds. It''s highly unintelligent to think that a person''s going to come illegally into this country and beg for assistance, or that your tax-paying money is going to pay for them.", "So you justify the news told you this BS, your president told you this BS, and then you believe it because it''s so much easier to believe all the garbage people are saying to you than to think for yourself. So, children, going to school, being indoctrinated with dumb, dumb, fake-ass history, fake-ass crap that''s going to do them absolutely no good in the real world, decided to think for themselves. To protest together, to protect people. In a world where they are told that human life has no value.", "So, if your child does do the walkout today, instead of you being angry or disciplining your child for standing up for something, I say be proud of them. If my son was to get suspended today, I''m not going to be mad at him. I''m not going to be mad. I''m going to think: I raised a child that has traveled the world, values human life, and understands no child deserves to be ripped away from their parents, no person deserves to be freaking shot and just murdered because it''s part of the agenda. So, if your child is one of these children..."]'),
  ('finnharryy', 'Being an undocumented person in the US isn’t even considered a crime. It’s a civil violation. #nokings', 'finnharryy', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_Nq4ncsLUAZK7vDV', '["Undocumented people commit less crime than American citizens, and that''s just a fact—you can look it up. So, this entire narrative that there''s a migrant crime wave that''s been spun by Trump is complete bullshit. And honestly, if you bought into it, I''m sorry, you got fucking scammed.", "I just found an article that Homeland Security has posted this week on a government website about how ICE has captured the \"worst of the worst\" illegal alien criminals in Los Angeles. It''s a list of 11 people, and there have been over 300 people that have been detained—probably way more, just that''s what''s being reported right now. And on this list of 11 of the worst of the worst, this guy was arrested for conspiracy to transport an...", "That''s the worst of the worst? Like, it''s just so obvious that it''s all—this is such a bullshit, fucking talking point that conservatives have rallied around. But the reason that it has so much traction amongst them is because you have to do a tiny bit of research to realize that it''s bullshit and, guess what? They don''t do that."]'),
  ('ilovechipotle1301', 'i’m so tired of this country right now. #humanrights #human #right #usa #southafrica #immigration #refugee', 'ilovechipotle1301', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_RRByWGj4i7ryCZZ', '["The population in South Africa is 90% black, but black people in South Africa only own 4% of privately owned land in the entire country. But somehow Trump is convinced that these 59 white South African refugees deserve to be housed and fed on the taxpayer dollar in the United States because they were being discriminated against in their home country.", "I just—it makes me so fucking sick to see that in the same week that a 16-year-old girl had her face slammed into the concrete by ICE because she was brought here as a minor into the United States by her parents, that our taxpayer dollars are simultaneously being spent on an expedited refugee process for white people in South Africa, where they only make up 10% of the population, but they own 96% of the fucking land. Are you kidding me?", "And their justification is that they believe that white people are being genocided in South Africa. So all of a sudden they have a problem with genocide, meanwhile the United States is literally funding a genocide in the West Bank. And for the record, that''s not even happening in South Africa. It''s been disproven and debunked multiple times, and it''s just Elon Musk spreading right-wing bullshit, white supremacist bullshit, as usual. That''s all this is—it''s just white supremacist bullshit all over again. I''m so tired."]'),
  ('itscandyinhere', 'Just do it legally! Then you deport them at their meeting, cut off the jobs they are doing to pay for the legal route, and only pedestal the rich or lucky ones that get through the immigration process within 2 years. Dont say just do it legally if you aren’t taking into account everything it takes to go though this process because it’s not as easy as some of yall are acting #foryou #fyp #immigrant #ice #immigration #system', 'itscandyinhere', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_PKQnmNBgCl2Pvc9', '["Some people are so dumb because they just think, \"just do it legally, you know, immigration isn''t that difficult. What have you been doing for the last 10 years?\" It takes longer than 10 years for some people. Imagine paying a lawyer for 10 years, that''s fucking expensive. Like, you cannot be serious when you''re like, \"do it legally, everyone should just do it legally\".", "Like yeah, a lot of people can do it legally, but it''s so difficult. You can''t blame them for not having it done within five fucking minutes, you know? Like, some of these people are trying to do it legally and you still deport them. What are they supposed to do?", "Like you could apply three different times, you''ll still have to wait for them to approve it. You have to apply, you have to do all this, you have to pay money, you have to prove everything. It''s a difficult process. People trying to do it legally are still struggling with that, you know, cause the system makes it so difficult for people to do it legally.", "Like I don''t think people realize immigration isn''t just a process where at the long time it''ll take a year. No, the long time it''s 20 to 30 years. Like genuinely it''s difficult."]'),
  ('jcodefit', 'CC: every white guy #iceout #minneapolis #fdt #fyp', 'jcodefit', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_7D5ThSuJnpC727h', '["\"Oh, I don''t really know what to do about it. Oh, it doesn''t affect me.\" The fuck it doesn''t affect you? The fuck it doesn''t affect you? Okay, fine. You don''t care about immigrants. You don''t care about people that didn''t get the proper documentation before they got here. Cool. That''s fine. You don''t care about your neighbors. Alright, whatever, get it. I get it. Okay, sure. You don''t care about brown people that are getting fucking dragged off the street just because they look like the neighbors that you don''t like. Okay, cool, you don''t care about them either.", "The fucking guy that got shot today looked like me. And I know you might not like me, but who gives a fuck? Because if you look like me, that could fucking be you, too. He''s helping a protester—First Amendment rights—while carrying a firearm legally—Second Amendment rights. And he gets shoved, beaten, shot—shot a fuck ton more times, in case you didn''t see the goddamn video. There''s a guy in the background clapping about it afterwards. And then, you have the federal government—and this is really where it fucking affects you, because if you don''t fucking get this part—the federal government comes out and goes, \"Oh, well, looks like self-defense, he was being really violent.\"", "I don''t think you fucking get it if you don''t fucking see what''s happening right now and you''re upset about it. It''s not about that guy. It''s not about Minneapolis. It''s not about the five-year-old that gets fucking snatched up and is told to go get the rest of his family. It''s not about the people that are just getting snatched off the streets. It''s about you. Because eventually it comes down to you unless you are them. And I fucking guarantee if you''re watching this, you''re not them. So do something about it.", "\"I don''t know what to do about it.\" I don''t care. You don''t have to go protest. If it''s in my city, I''m going. I''ll do it for you, I don''t give a fuck, okay? You don''t have to go protest. Donate your money. Donate your time. Go on socials, share it to your story, share it to your page. Just click the fucking buttons and watch it through so it can share and the algorithm pushes it to other people that need to see it. It''s unacceptable that the fucking federal government is just—just behind this shit. I studied history in college. This doesn''t fucking end well. Our best case scenario is that we start fucking doing something about it, because until we do, it''s fucking affecting all of us, dude."]'),
  ('jules_is_ok', 'USCIS officials pulled immigrants from their oath swearing ceremonies in Faneuil Hall in Boston on Thursday, December 4th, based on what country they were from. Their immigration status is now in limbo despite them doing everything the “right” way.', 'jules_is_ok', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_BNw9n7afob6JVzV', '["They took people from their oath-swearing ceremonies in Boston on Thursday. A group of immigrants showed up to Faneuil Hall to swear their oaths to become American citizens—you know, that last step that you take when you do everything the right way? When you fill out all the papers, and you pass the tests and the vetting, and you pay all the money, and you wait all that time, and you go, and you swear, and you become a citizen? They showed up for that, and they were asked—they lined them—they asked them, \"What country are you from?\" and picked them out of line based on what country they were from. Because a few countries they have just decided no longer are allowed to come here anymore.", "So these people—one of them a Haitian woman who has been here for 20 years, did everything the right way—was pulled out of line and now has no idea what her status is.", "I would love for these MAGA fucks that show up in my comments, who say, \"My grandparents came the right way, my so-and-so came the right way\"—they''re here, they''re doing it the right way, and they''re still getting pulled out of line at their oath-swearing ceremonies. Please defend that to me, cause I would love to hear it."]'),
  ('kylie.brewer', 'They voted away people’s rights thinking they wouldn’t be affected… Insane😭 #humanrights #leftist #education #immigrants #ushistory', 'kylie.brewer', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_SQ6VVEonOCTpBI9', '["If you are someone who has voted against human rights multiple times and something happens to you, you do not get to get on here and say, \"Oh my god, where is your empathy?\" You gleefully voted other people''s rights away, and now that there are consequences to those choices, you expect us to rally around you.", "This lady has been talking online like, \"Oh my god, like my fiancé, he got deported. My boyfriend got deported. He''s one of the good ones.\" Yeah, he''s a white immigrant from Europe. This lady voted for Trump thinking that he was going to deport essentially the black and brown immigrants and that her husband, for some weird reason, would be exempt from this. And now that he has been deported, she seriously expects the left and people who are members of these marginalized groups, like immigrants, black and brown people, and queer people, to rally around her? To have empathy for her?", "I don''t know how many times I have to say this, but Trump does not care about you. His regime does not care about you. You do not get to have selective empathy for people that look like you, and then scream, \"Oh my god, help me, help me\" when something bad happens as a result of your choices. And I hope that your boyfriend fucking leaves you because you''re clearly a very bad person who has no sympathy for his status as an immigrant."]'),
  ('liamslatermusic', 'they’re dangerous criminals right #ice #la #losangeles #immigrants #america #policies', 'liamslatermusic', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_pvt4buwGilLs5vp', '["\"The people coming here are violent.\" Do you know how many murders were committed last year by illegal immigrants? 29. Do you know how many murders were committed by white people last year? 9,000. What the fuck are you people talking about?", "If you are using one murder as a justification to deport an entire race of people, I better hear you screaming that we need to deport every single white person, because they are 300 times more likely to kill you.", "These people are coming here for a better life. They are not violent, they are not criminals. All they are doing is trying to work and better their lives. You guys need to shut up about this stuff; it''s ridiculous."]'),
  ('silver.9k', 'America is a country of Immigrants #unitedstates #immigrant #foryoupage #fyp #fypシ', 'silver.9k', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_xCAkHuTkTshS37R', '["Unpopular opinion here. What makes it that someone who was born here, that works a shitty 9-to-5 at Kmart, so much more special than an immigrant who works a shitty 9-to-5 at Kmart? To me, you guys are equal, or sometimes I see the immigrant as more American. Let''s be honest, what makes the average native American so much more special? You won the geographical lottery, so whoop-dee-doo, you''re better than everyone else?", "The immigrant had to flee their home, their family, their friends, their belongings, their status—just like our founding fathers did. What''s more American than that? Immigrants on average have to work harder, improve themselves for the possibility that people might treat them right. They have to like, know specific things about this country just to obtain a citizenship. It also costs money, and if they remain undocumented, they don''t get any of the benefits that poor Americans who have lived there their whole lives do.", "You are born here, yet you''re at a disadvantage compared to someone who comes here from somewhere else—Somalia, or Jordan, or Colombia, or whatever fucking country? Like, the obsession people have, oh, the like superiority they have over documented and undocumented immigrants, it''s just bullshit. You''re not better than anyone by any method."]'),
  ('wiscocowboy1', 'They ARE deporting legal US citizens… People need to wake up! #politics #liberal #democrat #💙 #leftist #liberaltiktok #usa', 'wiscocowboy1', 'pro_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_LGrYgxvG5Wkcfnq', '["\"The U.S. government and ICE ain''t deporting no legal U.S. citizens!\" Oh, really? Well, tell that to Luis Leon, an 82-year-old man in Pennsylvania who''s been living in the U.S. legally for almost 40 years. Luis had asylum here, escaped torture in Chile back in the ''80s, worked hard in a factory here, raised his family here, paid his taxes here, and even retired here. He''s not undocumented, not a criminal—he''s just old and lost his green card.", "So what does Luis do after losing his green card? He decides to do the responsible thing and go to the immigration office with his wife to get it replaced. And horrifically, instead of getting his green card replaced, ICE shows up, handcuffs him, drags him away from his wife, and disappears him. No explanation, no charges, just gone. His wife was held in the building for 10 hours before she was released, and his family was left in the dark for weeks.", "Luckily, his family was able to track him down to a hospital in Guatemala—a country he literally has zero connection to. This is a man who should be playing with his grandkids right now, not being forcibly dumped into a foreign country. Well, and of course, now ICE is saying that they''re gonna investigate themselves. Well, if you''re a member of ICE and you''re watching this, you can go fuck yourself. So the next time Republicans say, \"well, the U.S. isn''t deporting legal U.S. citizens,\" call BS on them, because they are deporting legal U.S. citizens, and they''re hoping you don''t notice."]'),
  ('1984oregonian', 'The liberal fatigue is exhausting and honestly I’m over it…. If you hate it here that much then go ahead and move to one of the other countries that you have been supporting and protesting, I’ll stay and support my country and you can go support the others like you claim too #foryoupage #fypシ #foryou #fypシ゚viral', '1984oregonian', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_Tl9LTTYzWqFqMXf', '["I know I''m going to piss some people off and ruffle some new feathers on both sides of the aisle, and I really don''t give a shit anymore. I am so done with all of the fake outrage and the fake compassion from any Democratic, liberal, left person in this country.", "First was the bullshit outrage over ICE. You guys acted like Trump was inaugurated and magically created this department that never existed before, completely ignoring the fact that it was created in 2003 and has been used by every single president since then, due to the Muslim attacks on our nation on 9/11. And you can''t argue that it''s the way he''s doing things because guess what? Not only did Obama have the largest amount of illegal immigrants deported, he also had the largest error rate. I don''t remember anybody screaming in outrage for the over 300 American citizens that Obama illegally detained.", "And before you come in here and say ''what about no new wars? Thought he was supposed to be the president with no new wars, hands off Iran,'' your ignorance is showing. He didn''t start a new war; he took out a Muslim terrorist that the United States has actively been fighting against for decades. It''s absolutely fucking insane to me that the very same people who have called me a Nazi and a racist, and said that he is Hitler, that I''m brainwashed and I''m a part of a cult, can''t see the irony in the fact that they are now mad Trump took out a terrorist leader who is trying to eliminate anybody who wasn''t following their religious path.", "By arguing with every single thing that this president and his administration do, you are proving that you don''t care about the policies, whether they''re good for America or bad for America. You just care about your hatred for that person. Think about it: the very same people who were just screaming ''Free Palestine'' are now pissed off that Trump might actually free Palestine.", "If you are so unhappy with the way things are going here in the United States that you felt the need to come onto social media and tell the Islamic regime that ''hey, you actually support them,'' guess what? You don''t have to stay here. You have free will. You get to leave. Just because you''re the loudest doesn''t mean you''re the majority. In fact, every time you guys come on here with some new bullshit cause or outraged about some other thing, you are pushing people further and further away from your movement. And soon enough, you are going to realize just how many of us there are on this side and how few of you there are on that side."]'),
  ('amsm2025', '"I''m in full support of deportation." 🗣️SEND THEM BACK🥾', 'amsm2025', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_qkdX0MW732PGH1s', '["I am in full support of deportation. If you are a Black American, you should be in full support of deportation because this is messing with your own bag. Y''all don''t even see the scope because y''all want to be in your feelings about, \"Oh, this is inhumane, and they just working, they just working.\" No, they came here illegally, man. And yeah, they''re here just working, but guess what? Those are jobs that Americans could be filling. You know? But the difference is, Americans are going to make you pay. You''ve got to pay Americans, bro. These people are coming over here and working for crumbs, peanuts. If you are over here illegally, you''ve got to go home, man.", "That''s my whole point of supporting deportation, because it''s fucking up our bag, man. Black men, we''re the last hired, first fired, and then if we don''t have a job, we''re out here robbing Peter to pay Paul. Niggas start learning how to scam and shit. Nobody wants to live like that. People want to make an honest living, bro. But it ain''t about no race thing with me at all, you know what I mean? If you''re here illegally, I don''t care what country you come from, your ass has got to go.", "Send these folks back, man. And anybody in their feelings, I don''t care. I done got two violations for saying \"send them back.\" Man, I ought to figure out how to sue these folks, man. How the hell you gon'' put a strike on me because I said send them back? I can say that. Send them back. Send these people back to the hell where they came from."]'),
  ('braedensorbo', 'Disgusting #foryou #minnesota #foryoupage #fyp', 'braedensorbo', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_85jeNavXOtbqdh8', '["Well, here''s something the media is not gonna show you. ICE officially released a list of the most dangerous criminals that they''ve arrested since arriving in Minneapolis just a week or two ago. Seeing as there are literal riots happening in Minneapolis to protect these people, I thought it would be fun to go over the mugshots of each individual and what crime they''ve committed. Quick side note before I start, these are absolutely disgusting and there''s way too many to go over in a single post, so I''m just gonna do the first couple on the list.", "Sriudorn Phaivan, a Laotian illegal who has had a deportation order since 2018, was charged with strong-armed sodomy of a boy and strong-armed sodomy of a girl. Tou Vang was charged with sexual assault of a girl under the age of 13 and soliciting a child for that. Has had a deportation order since 2006. The third Laotian on the list, Chong Vue, was arrested and charged with raping a 12-year-old girl and kidnapping a child with the intent to sexually assault them, has had a deportation order since 2004. Ge Yang, convicted of rape, strangulation, assault with a weapon. Deportation order since 2012. Kou Lor, found guilty of rape, rape with a weapon, sexual assault of a child. Deportation order since 1996. Hernan Cortes-Valencia, sexual assault of a child, DUI. Deportation order since 2016.", "The list goes on and on and on. There are several photos here, all with similar crimes. And this, this is who people are protesting to protect. This is who you wanna keep in this country."]'),
  ('farrightblonde3', 'I’m so tired of this moral highground bs. If you are okay with the over a million abortions that happen every year and the over 10 million people who are currently in this country illegally you have no high ground. Hope this helps 🫶🏻 #immigration #illegalimmigrants #prolife4life #prolifetiktok #republican #conservative #republicansoftiktok #conservativesoftiktok #fyp', 'farrightblonde3', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_nJulTb9xQyTyd09', '["Y''all Democrats and liberals and leftists—all of y''all—swear that you have some big old moral high ground. I don''t go around calling people stupid and fat and ugly and uneducated. That''s all you. There''s definitely not a moral high ground there.", "I don''t even call you guys uneducated. I literally tell you to critically think about the resources you are looking at. Which goes to everyone: critically think about what you are looking at.", "So no, you guys don''t have a moral high ground. You guys are okay with killing babies. You guys are okay with illegal immigrants who broke the law to get here being here. Every single country in this world has immigration laws, but America''s doesn''t matter anymore, I guess. So I don''t want to hear anything about moral high grounds anymore. That''s what this is."]'),
  ('ill_comment_now', '#trump #homan #deportation #liberal @QueenBee10', 'ill_comment_now', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_MW4UMaQSzhjLVB2', '["So let me get something straight. You liberals are hand-wringing and going crazy over Trump willing to deport people that should not have been here anyway. And that''s a bad thing they''re crying about it. But you''re the ones who let all these people in by taking away Trump''s border mandates.", "So that''s sort of like the ship is sinking because you ran into an iceberg willingly. Now we have to repair the boat and bail the water out. It''s your damn fault you let all these people in. We''re the grown-ups that have to send them all back, and we''re the ones that look like the bad guys. No, it''s your fault."]'),
  ('jr808tv2.5', 'nan', 'jr808tv2.5', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_147fUGZMxxzIMGS', '["\"But they''re all getting deported.\" Why do I care? Why? Why should I give a fuck? When it came down to it, it was like, \"No, me not Black, me Dominican.\"", "Well, guess what? The fuck you about to go, buddy. Guess where you''re going."]'),
  ('justinminchow402', 'nan', 'justinminchow402', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_4rRq3iY8HGmL1zs', '["All right, let''s get really blunt with this. Instead of demonizing anybody that supports the border laws of America, let''s think about why we support them and why we voted for it in November. This has absolutely nothing to do with hating immigrants. This has absolutely nothing to do with lacking empathy. This is us being fed up.", "We are fed up with American citizens losing their lives to people who should have never been in this country. We are fed up with fentanyl being smuggled across our border, killing thousands. We are fed up with women being taken advantage of and sold and sex trafficked. We are fed up with seeing headlines of 120,000 missing children. Children we know we are never going to find. I mean seriously, let that one sink in. Over 120,000 missing children. And people act like there''s no crisis.", "We are not heartless, we are horrified. We are horrified to hear about rape trees along the border where traffickers assault women and then hang their clothing from trees as trophies. We are horrified to hear about the pedophile rings that are utilizing sex traffickers to steal children. And it''s time to be really honest with yourself. You know that there''s nobody out here throwing parties, celebrating the deportation of families. It''s tough. It''s tragic.", "But you can''t support illegal immigration because you''re advocating for open borders, and when you do that you only embolden the violent criminals and cartels that are utilizing that system. And simply demonizing anybody that supports law, order, and accountability only shuts down any sort of conversation that could be had about reforming the immigration system so that these people don''t feel like it''s their best option.", "We don''t support law and order because we lack empathy, it''s because we have empathy. For the vulnerable being taken advantage of. For the women being abused. For the children being lost. We are not cruel to believe in borders. We just care enough to say that enough is enough."]'),
  ('k_dub_h', 'nan', 'k_dub_h', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_6PE0etUk1yqvuAk', '["\"Trump is talking about ending all migration from third world countries and denaturalizing any U.S. citizen that does not align with so-called American values.\"", "Yeah, and? We don''t want people coming to America who don''t wanna be Americans, and who most certainly do not respect American culture.", "This is a very easy concept. If you come from a shitty country, don''t bring the shittiness from your country with you, because we don''t want it here in America. If you love your country so much, and you love your government so much, go back. Why are you here to begin with?", "I don''t understand why people are acting like immigration, deportation, revoking visas, revoking citizenship is a novel concept. This has been going on for decades. And also happens in other countries as well, not just the US. America and Americans want their America back."]'),
  ('leelorising', 'This was mostly jokes, but you know what they say, there is truth in jest 👏🏻🇺🇸🇺🇸🇺🇸 #republicans #republicansoftiktok #democrats #leftist #politics #politicalsatire #trump2024🇺🇸', 'leelorising', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_c1RiykPh7NqPvOz', '["I’m not even a Republican, but every time someone on the left opens their mouth right now, like I am this close, I am this close to becoming a Republican. When I hear the words \"no human is illegal\" coming from a group of people that more than likely own fucking passports, like I’m I''m this close to putting a MAGA hat in my cart. Like, I am trying to be reasonable, okay? I am I am trying. I have very leftist views, okay? I don’t like guns. I believe in trans rights. I believe that if you’re a consenting adult, you can do whatever the hell you want to with your body. But when you start replacing words like \"mother\" with \"birth giver,\" and you see people like Gavin Newsom calling his own wife \"the first partner of California,\" like I can feel my soul applying for an NRA membership.", "Like, I have traditionally leftist views, okay? I recycle, I believe in clean energy, I believe in healthcare for all, I understand and acknowledge that racism is alive and well in America today. But when I ask for something as simple as border security, and you start throwing out words like \"racist,\" and \"fascist,\" and \"bigot,\" and \"authoritarian,\" I start googling where to buy a fucking F-250. And I don’t even like trucks. I hate trucks. I would never drive a truck. But the way you guys are acting is literally making me want to do something so cringe, like fly a giant American flag off of my front porch.", "And don’t even get me started on Fourth of July. Oh my god. Every time that a leftist says that they’re not celebrating Fourth of July or that Fourth of July is canceled, I promise you, another piece of American flag clothing gets put in my cart. I mean, maybe at this point I should thank you for reviving my patriotism, because every time you open your mouths, I become more and more of a patriot for this country."]'),
  ('ricanencanto', '#trump #immigration #america #election #republican #fyp #fyppppppppppppppppppppppp #usa #kamala #nyc', 'ricanencanto', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_rE7DXKPlCDS0mew', '["You guys, since Trump was announced the winner—normally, I live in Fordham, and normally in Fordham, all you see is like tables with tents and people just taking the whole sidewalk where you can''t even walk. 42nd Street is full of criminals and shit. Since Trump was announced the winner, when I tell you our streets have been clean, our train system have been clean of people, and like, you could walk on the sidewalks—like, I can''t even explain to you the feeling of peace that I feel, and safety. Like, ugh, it just feels so great. Like, thank you to all the people that voted for Trump. Like, this needed to happen.", "And yes, I''m Puerto Rican. I''m not against immigration. But when you come here to vandalize, to steal, to rape, and then to laugh at the taxpayer, telling them to go to work so that you can eat while you lay up in a five-star hotel for free? Yeah, it''s time for you to go home. And whoever don''t like it, you don''t gotta like it. It''s my right as a citizen, as a natural-born citizen—even though I was born in Michigan, but Puerto Ricans are natural-born citizens, so, sorry.", "We gotta worry about us first. America first. Like, y''all chose to come here, y''all chose to do whatever y''all did. And because—not everybody was doing crimes and all that, but a lot of the people were. And because of them, now all of y''all gotta go home. Ta-ta! Enjoy the trip back. They''re gonna fly you coach! So, to all the people that voted for Trump, I just want to say thank you. I voted for Trump. And before you ask, New York passed a law that felons can vote again in 2021, so, keep your comments to yourself. Trump is back. Let''s get this country in order. Let''s be America first. And to all the people that came, I wish y''all a safe trip home. And now you have stories you can tell people, that you lived in New York for a little while, or America, and how great it is. Bye."]'),
  ('thee_bluff_city', 'Those liberals will FAFO real quick.  #illegalimmigrants #ICE #liberalteachers #liberals #democrats #teachers #fyp #viralnews #fypp #Trending #creatorsearchinsights', 'thee_bluff_city', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_uxgTfDL1tiBIEZP', '["I''ve been seeing video after video of female teachers and dudes that are talking about, \"Oh, if ICE were to come to my part of town, I''m gonna stand ten toes down.\" Nine out of ten of y''all wouldn''t bust a grape in a fruit fight. Y''all think y''all can take on people who are trained in advanced combat and trained with weapons? Y''all really think y''all gonna go knuckle up with them?", "You know what? Go right ahead. Every last one of y''all. Every—no, you know what? Go right ahead, every last one of y''all. \"Oh, they''re not gonna take my kids, da-da-da-da-da.\" Go right ahead. Go ahead, go pick a fight with those ICE agents, please. I want to see the videos of y''all getting molly-whopped by those agents. I want to see those videos just so I can laugh at how fucking stupid a lot of y''all are.", "Go ahead. Go ahead and protect these illegal immigrants, and watch what you fucking get. FAFO."]'),
  ('therealistlounge', 'Y’all got so much to say now huh 🤨 #politicstiktok #politics #liberallogic #trump #illegalimmigrants #massdeportations #liberaltears #biden #prettyrealisttalk #cutewinterboots', 'therealistlounge', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_1vk3cmAC7cgjOoJ', '["I just got to say this before I go to bed. I just find it kind of crazy that y''all are really out there protesting to keep illegal people in this country. Y''all haven''t said not one word about all of those children that went missing because that border was open. Not one word. Not one word.", "Fox even showed that there was a whole line of kids that got dropped off at the border. The youngest was like two. They had addresses to places that they didn''t even know where they were going. There was no parents in sight. Y''all ain''t said shit about it. Nothing.", "I haven''t heard y''all say anything about any of the women who have been S-A''d by any of those demigrants that have been over in this country. Y''all haven''t said anything about these police officers who have arrested these violent offenders who they know have committed crimes, only for them to let them right back out to commit more crimes.", "Y''all seem to think that the reason that this deportation is happening is only because people are being racist, or they''re being callous, or this, that, and the other, and that''s not it. When Trump said that they didn''t send their best, that''s what he meant. Like I said before, it ain''t got nothing to do with the illegal immigrants that was already here. It''s about the ones that came within the last four years.", "Y''all out there in California, waving y''all little flag, doing y''all little C-walk, listening to y''all \"Fuck Donald Trump\" music as if he''s the reason why y''all getting de-ported. If anything, you need to be mad at the mudderfucker who allowed all of those people to come in, that blew y''all cover over the last couple of years, because they made it real hot for you.", "It was all fun and games until kids came up missing, until young women were being S-A''d. But see, y''all don''t want to talk about that. Y''all don''t care nothing about how it harmed Americans, how it harmed the education system, how it harmed the job market. So no matter how many videos y''all make about how American citizens who are speaking Spanish are being arrested, it''s not going to change the fact that all of these things have happened because of how your ass voted. How you voted. So this, really, is your fault. Not ours, not Trump''s. Yours."]'),
  ('zackheeter', 'Do they not see why people from socialist countries or countries with kings want to come here? I’ll give you a hint, they don’t work out. #fyp #politics #republican #maga #conspiracy', 'zackheeter', 'anti_immigration', 'https://ubcbusiness.eu.qualtrics.com/ControlPanel/File.php?F=F_LCM5q8KDoRRu2qh', '["\"No person is illegal.\" Really? Then why does every country on the planet have a border?", "\"Well, we live on stolen land. We stole this from the Native Americans.\" Why haven''t you left yet? If you''ve known this for years, why are you still here?", "\"Well, socialism rocks. We don''t need capitalism here.\" Okay, well, if we live on stolen land and you want socialism, why don''t you go over to Cuba or Venezuela and let me know how that works out?", "\"Well, being gay in this country, you don''t know what it''s like to walk in my shoes.\" Okay, go to Palestine or Ukraine and be openly gay—the ones that you were protesting for—and let me know how that goes. But I probably won''t ever hear from you ever again.", "They truly just can never get it. Like, they''re protesting no kings in the streets, on video, or on social media, not getting arrested for it—they''re free to say it. But yet, they won''t go to a socialist country like Venezuela and do that same thing. Go do that there, or go do that in Ukraine, and see what happens.", "They can''t see the irony that they hate the country they live in, but they don''t see the reason why people from all over the world want to come here and not in their home countries, where there''s actual kings and actual socialism."]');
