  ('enliven.inner.inte_c05', 'enliven.inner.inte', '@oramirez', 'Kids like to get out of class. What is said is through all this everyone forgot about stranger danger, school shootings, etc. Kids don’t have the right to walk out of class. Schools don’t have the right to promote and allow this. I work at a high school, asked kids asked me what I thought, I said I don’t share my views at work. The student actually said they didn’t know what it was all about, just wanted to get out class.', 0, 5),
