  ('enliven.inner.inte_c07', 'enliven.inner.inte', '@gabriel_tuc49', 'Oh yes, so proud.....while principals are being fired, parents are pulling their kids and school boards are facing backlash. Good God Almighty. 🤦', 0, 7),
  ('enliven.inner.inte_c08', 'enliven.inner.inte', '@michelle.n2', 'So wrong, children need to be in school. not out protesting. They have no idea on why they are protesting. Stop this nonsense', 0, 8),
