  ('enliven.inner.inte_c10', 'enliven.inner.inte', '@jacqueline.b0', 'Where were all of that protesters when Biden and the Obama administration were shipping immigrants out of the country. No protesters, so no protesters were killed. The Trump administration is doing the same thing as the past administrations, but protesters are interfering and getting killed. Think about it.', 0, 10),
  ('finnharryy_c01', 'finnharryy', '@rasmussenjoshua', 'I think the bigger problem is the amount of funding/attention undocumented immigrants get vs immigrants going thru a legal process.', 0, 1),
