  ('ilovechipotle1301_c06', 'ilovechipotle1301', '@brent.k8', 'I’m past being angry', 0, 6),
  ('ilovechipotle1301_c07', 'ilovechipotle1301', '@purposemovement765', 'EXHAUSTINGGGGG!🤦🏿‍♀️🤦🏿‍♀️🤦🏿‍♀️🤦🏿‍♀️🤦🏿‍♀️', 0, 7),
  ('ilovechipotle1301_c08', 'ilovechipotle1301', '@julie.r5', 'And they are not even native to S Africa. Pretty shitty, right?', 0, 8),
  ('ilovechipotle1301_c09', 'ilovechipotle1301', '@frazierdanny', 'Hang in there we need your voice for the next 3 fucking years……', 0, 9),
  ('ilovechipotle1301_c10', 'ilovechipotle1301', '@mary_nov43', 'Musk is from South Africa and has Trumps ear. Trump believes only the most outrageous things that people tell him.', 0, 10),
  ('itscandyinhere_c01', 'itscandyinhere', '@elizabeth_mcm19', 'it took my parents 10+ years and i’m a U.S citizen. ppl look at me crazy when i tell them that', 0, 1),
  ('itscandyinhere_c02', 'itscandyinhere', '@researchsmile627', 'My mom tried to apply 3 times , she get rejected every time', 0, 2),
  ('itscandyinhere_c03', 'itscandyinhere', '@ontraditional864', 'It''s not supposed to be easy, it''s made to make sure they you actually want to live in the country', 0, 3),
  ('itscandyinhere_c04', 'itscandyinhere', '@elizabeth_riv74', 'I know someone who’s mom paid 11k and she still had to wait 15 years', 0, 4),
  ('itscandyinhere_c05', 'itscandyinhere', '@elizabeth_riv74', 'We are actually one of the easiest countries to legally immagrate too. First world countries like Japan make it incredibly difficult. We are also one of the easiest to migrate too incases of asylum. Living in America(or any first world country) is a privilege. That is why it costs and take it’s as long as it does. You’re absolutely correct it is difficult and it could years or even decades. But living here is a privilege, not judt something you get. Just like any other developed country on this planet.', 0, 5),
  ('itscandyinhere_c06', 'itscandyinhere', '@christinaturner', 'Yea we have immigration laws to keep things safe and fair. The same reason we don’t let random people into America is the same reasons we don’t let strangers into our house. And it’s unfair to people who come here legally and spent time and money to come live in America and legal immigrants are enraged by it.', 0, 6),
  ('itscandyinhere_c07', 'itscandyinhere', '@aaron.n1', 'if you can''t do it legally don''t do it at all or expect consequences', 0, 7),
  ('itscandyinhere_c08', 'itscandyinhere', '@cassandra53', 'This makes no sense a country isn’t responsible for and another country’s person if they want to come and be citizens then they should have to be successful at least if that country is doing bad well tell the leaders of that country to be better a country is not responsible for another country people so make it make sense', 0, 8),
  ('itscandyinhere_c09', 'itscandyinhere', '@downattack115', 'then when they do it llegally you get accused of it being fake🤦🏽‍♀️', 0, 9),
  ('itscandyinhere_c10', 'itscandyinhere', '@mary_nov43', 'It took my family 10 years to get here …that was over 30 years ago', 0, 10),
  ('jcodefit_c01', 'jcodefit', '@chad34', 'And they turned around and detained everyone who was a witness. Detained because of simply being present. That should scare everyone.', 0, 1),
  ('jcodefit_c02', 'jcodefit', '@robin_bra47', 'It blows my mind how people are ok with this, I’m terrified 😞', 0, 2),
  ('jcodefit_c03', 'jcodefit', '@julie.r5', 'He was the best of society. An ICU RN at the VA hospital. And he was executed in the street for trying to help someone, a reflex that anyone in healthcare would have. I’ve been crying on and off all day. This is a nightmare', 0, 3),
  ('jcodefit_c04', 'jcodefit', '@rasmussenjoshua', 'If the choices are obey or lose your life, then we don’t live in a “free country“', 0, 4),
  ('jcodefit_c05', 'jcodefit', '@donnaarroyo', 'My eyes are tired from seeing the truth', 0, 5),
  ('jcodefit_c06', 'jcodefit', '@kimberly63', 'THIS DOESN''T END WELL. Honestly my nervous system isn''t going to make it until November. And even then, what? Not evem Dems taking back house and senate can stop Trump. He doesn''t play by the rules. We''re all so angry, disgusted and tired. We have to keep speaking up!', 0, 6),
  ('jcodefit_c07', 'jcodefit', '@christinaturner', 'There is nothing u or we can do. Just stay home and dont out yourself at risk.', 0, 7),
  ('jcodefit_c08', 'jcodefit', '@beth.w3', 'THEY ARE TRYING TO DESENSITIZE US', 0, 8),
  ('jcodefit_c09', 'jcodefit', '@michelle.r5', 'we need help from outside our borders to institute a regime change by any means necessary. our own government is complicit in murdering it''s own citizens and instilling fear until we all hide and comply.', 0, 9),
  ('jcodefit_c10', 'jcodefit', '@darlene.r9', 'They don’t think it applies to them, they dont think it’ll ever happen to them.', 0, 10),
