  ('liamslatermusic_c05', 'liamslatermusic', '@glasswrong210', 'Majority, if not all of the murders done by illegal immigrants is against legal citizens. Majority of the murders done by white legsl citizens is against another white legal citizen. You also keep saying to deport white people as if the punishment to murder is deportations. Deportations is punishment for entering the country illegally or being in the country illegally. You’re lucky the US doesn’t punish the illegal immigrsnt murderers by keeping them in prison for 70 years and then deporting them. Also you’re acting like the only way to come to America and get a better life is through illegal immigration. Sure, it takes 15-20 years to get approved but if you really wanted it, you would do it.', 0, 5),
