  ('silver.9k_c02', 'silver.9k', '@vanessa.v2', 'we love immigrants here. immigrants are the backbone of america. what isn''t, are illegal immigrants, people who cut in line, abuse the system, abuse our resources, spend years and years in our country illegally like leaches.', 0, 2),
  ('silver.9k_c03', 'silver.9k', '@courtney_con30', 'The first immigrants didn’t ask the native Americans for permission. They abused their kindness, committed genocide and spread disease amongst their communities, stealing their traditions and resources. Now only 1% of America is Native. Who are the true leaches here?', 0, 3),
  ('silver.9k_c04', 'silver.9k', '@christopher_dav93', 'i get it but does that mean we should jus remove immigration laws? everyone can go here you dont need to be a citizen you can live in a country undocumented and illegally which you know you are doing is illegal? i really hate politics bc its stuff like this that both sides are wrong', 0, 4),
  ('silver.9k_c05', 'silver.9k', '@threatnot958', 'opposite being American is a white guy in the country', 0, 5),
