  ('ill_comment_now_c08', 'ill_comment_now', '@torresjason', 'every single person mad at this is mad because its true, thats the only reason', 0, 8),
  ('ill_comment_now_c09', 'ill_comment_now', '@reyesbenjamin', 'deport every last one, if you broke the law to get here you dont get to stay, simple as that', 0, 9),
